<figure id="Sx4.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>Performance and efficiency comparison of VLM4TS versus language model–based baseline methods on benchmark datasets. “Tokens” reports the average number of tokens consumed per time series; “Time” indicates the average elapsed (wall-clock) time to generate detections per time series. Efficiency metrics have been adjusted to account for the methods’ window and step size difference.</figcaption>
