<section id="A2.SSx9" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">Full F1 scores for Table 1</h3>

<figure id="A2.T13" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 13: </span>Full F1 scores of ViT4TS and VLM4TS versus trained-from-scratch and time-series-pretrained baselines for MSL, SMAP and realTweets (Tweets).</figcaption>
